OL,3,CFundraiser killed in small aircraft
OL,4,Ccrash died from multiple injuries -
OL,5,Cinquest
OL,7,FAn inquest has heard how a
OL,8,FLeicestershire woman killed in a small
OL,9,Faircraft crash in the Middle East died
OL,10,Ffrom multiple severe traumatic
OL,11,Finjuries.
OL,13,FClaire Lomas was left paralysed from
OL,14,Fthe waist down after a riding accident
OL,15,Fin 2007.
OL,17,FIn July 2024, the 44-year-old from
OL,18,FMelton Mowbray was flying a microlight
OL,19,Fplane in Jordan when it veered off the
OL,20,Froad after landing and crashed into a
OL,21,Frock.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/2
