OL,3,CFundraiser killed in small aircraft
OL,4,Ccrash died from multiple injuries -
OL,5,Cinquest
OL,7,FShe was rushed to hospital by air
OL,8,Fambulance but died several weeks
OL,9,Flater. Her family have not attended
OL,10,Fthe inquest which is expected to last
OL,11,Fthree days.
OL,13,FMore to follow.
